  "description": "Temporal server (auto-setup image) on krg-prod: namespace + workflow-outcome counts (headline tiles follow the time picker via $__range; the outcomes table shows fixed 1h/24h/7d/30d windows), success rate, workflow duration percentiles, gRPC request/error rates, frontend + persistence latency, and Go runtime. Scraped over the docker network at temporal:8000 (job=\"temporal\"). Metric names verified against the live :8000/metrics endpoint (auto-setup 1.29.7): Temporal's tally/Prometheus exporter emits BARE counter names (service_requests / service_errors / workflow_success / workflow_failed / workflow_cancel — NO _total suffix), histograms as *_bucket (service_latency / persistence_latency), and its OWN Go-runtime gauges (num_goroutines / memory_heapinuse), not the standard go_* / process_* names. Only success/failed/cancel workflow-outcome counters are emitted by this version; timeout/terminate/continued-as-new are absent.",
